Sample Image Data License
=========================

The images under this directory (rock/, paper/, scissors/) are a subset of
15 images, otherwise unmodified, from the test split of the Rock Paper
Scissors dataset by Laurence Moroney.

  Copyright (c) Laurence Moroney (lmoroney@gmail.com / laurencemoroney.com)
  Source: https://laurencemoroney.com/datasets.html

The dataset is released under the Creative Commons Attribution 2.0 license
(CC BY 2.0, https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/2.0/): free to share and
adapt for all uses, commercial or non-commercial, provided appropriate credit
is given to Laurence Moroney and no additional restrictions are placed on
downstream users.

These images are bundled solely as first-run sample input so the Blueprint's
labeling loop can be exercised from a clean clone. They are licensed
separately from the application source code, which is governed by the
repository's Apache-2.0 LICENSE.
